---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Articles
description: "Every Band of One article: client workflows, getting paid, AI done right, systems and SOPs, and honest tool comparisons for one-person service businesses."
permalink: /blog/
---
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>Articles</h1>
    <p class="lead">Practical guides for the admin side of a one-person service business, organized by topic.</p>
    <nav aria-label="Topics" class="chips">{% for c in categories | orderCategories %}<a href="#{{ c.slug }}">{{ c.name }}</a>{% endfor %}</nav>
  </header>
  {%- for c in categories | orderCategories %}
  {%- set posts = collections.posts | byCategory(c.slug) %}
  {%- if posts.length %}
  <section class="section tight" id="{{ c.slug }}" aria-labelledby="h-{{ c.slug }}">
    <h2 id="h-{{ c.slug }}"><a href="/category/{{ c.slug }}/">{{ c.name }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ c.short }}</p>
    <div class="grid three">{% for post in posts %}{% include "partials/card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
  </section>
  {%- endif %}
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
